 "text": "Home - Norfolk Crush\nGrower Portal\nHours\n402-370-4910\nFacebook\nLinkedin\nInstagram\nX-twitter\nYoutube\nHome\nAbout\nLeadership\nGrain Merchandisers\nCareers\nNews\nMap\nBid/Offers\nSoybeans\nSoybean Meal\nSoybean Hulls\nSoybean Oil\nGallery\nContact\nHome\nAbout\nLeadership\nGrain Merchandisers\nCareers\nNews\nMap\nBid/Offers\nSoybeans\nSoybean Meal\nSoybean Hulls\nSoybean Oil\nGallery\nContact\nQuestions about the grain markets?\nCall one of our Norfolk Crush team members today\nLEARN MORE\nWHO WE ARE\nIMAGE GALLERY\nJOIN OUR TEAM\nLATEST CRUSH NEWS\nMemorial Day Closure\nNurturing Innovation from Soybean Fields to Fueling Futures\nSustainability, innovation, and waste reduction are at the core of everything we do at Norfolk Crush. Through collaborative agreements with soybean farmers, we are able to ensure a shorter supply chain of high-quality feedstock. Our partnership with local soybean farmers reduces the carbon footprint of manufacturing products like vegetable oil, soybean meal, and renewable diesel.\nEco-Friendly Excellence\nUnveiling Multifaceted Benefits of Soybean Crushing\nRenewable Resource\nReduces Greenhouse Gas Emissions\nSupports Local Economies\nImproves Engine Performance\nSupports Agriculture\nVersatile Application\nEnergy Independent\nIncentive for Innovation\n402-370-4910\n3820 North 1st Street\nNorfolk, Nebraska 68701\nAbout Us\nLeadership\nNews\nGallery\nCareers\nContact\nFacebook\nLinkedin\nInstagram\nX-twitter\nYoutube\nCopyright 2026 Norfolk Crush\nWebsite by Fusebox Marketing",
